     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Dear all,<div><br></div><div>I am quite new with ggplot2, that I find more intuitive than lattice, and I ran into a problem with the automatic generation of legend</div><div><br></div><div>I want to plot two (or more) variables that are all in the same dataframe (called cin), which I do using :</div><div><br></div><div>ggplot(cin,aes(x=t)) + geom_line(aes(y=re,colour=&#39;Enemy richness&#39;)) + geom_line(aes(y=rv,colour=&#39;Victim richness&#39;)) + facet_grid(Ar~Ur)</div><div><br></div><div>The result is<br><div>\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br><img height=\"385\" width=\"458\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/857b5256d77994fd/Capture%20d%E2%80%99%C3%A9cran%202010-08-07%20%C3%A0%2017.43.42.png?part=0.1.1&amp;view=1\"></span></font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">My problem is the title of the legend. I am sure there is a way to specificy it, and my naive guess would be that I need to add an option in the first &#39;aes&#39; the one within ggplot)?</span></font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Can anybody help with this?</span></font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">t</span></font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12px\">---------------------------------------</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">--------</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">--------</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">---</span></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Timothée POISOT<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span> Ph.D. Student<br>--<br>Institut des Sciences de l&#39;Evolution, Université Montpellier 2, CC 065<br>Place Eugène Bataillon                            34095 Montpellier CEDEX 5<br>--<br>Phone / Fax <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t</span>      <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span></span></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"tel:+33%204%2067%2014%2040%2061\" value=\"+33467144061\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(+33)4 67 14 40 61</a></span></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br>E-mail   <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>      <span> </span></span></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tpo...@um2.fr</a></span></font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Web     <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t</span> <a href=\"http://www.timotheepoisot.fr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.timotheepoisot.fr/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792382434305000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3MeF82dRX3YEvKPhita5EN\">http://www.timotheepoisot.fr/</a></span></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">---------------------------------------</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">--------</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">--------</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">---</span></span></span></font></div></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<br></div></div>"
